<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Clipiccolo — third-party licenses</title>
  <style>
    /* Clipiccolo "Caffè Piccolo" tokens (DESIGN.md): crema desk, milk sheets, espresso ink; both themes.
       The page opens from the install folder, so fonts fall back to the system when Bricolage/DM Mono are absent. */
    :root {
      --desk: #F3EDE2; --sheet: #FFFDF9; --sheet-2: #F8F2E8;
      --ink: #2A1F18; --ink-2: #6E6157;
      --line: rgba(42, 31, 24, 0.11); --line-strong: rgba(42, 31, 24, 0.22);
      --pistachio: #8DB443; --pistachio-ink: #4F6E1E; --pistachio-soft: #E6EDD2;
      color-scheme: light dark;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --desk: #17120E; --sheet: #211A15; --sheet-2: #2A221C;
        --ink: #F3EADF; --ink-2: #B5A797;
        --line: rgba(243, 234, 223, 0.10); --line-strong: rgba(243, 234, 223, 0.19);
        --pistachio-ink: #B2D46E; --pistachio-soft: rgba(166, 203, 94, 0.14);
      }
    }
    body {
      margin: 0 auto; max-width: 860px; padding: 48px 16px 72px;
      background: var(--desk); color: var(--ink);
      font: 14px/1.55 "Bricolage Grotesque", "Segoe UI Variable Text", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    ::selection { background: var(--pistachio-soft); color: var(--ink); }
    h1 { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    h1::after { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 0.17em; height: 0.17em; margin-left: 0.05em; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pistachio); }
    h2 { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 40px 0 12px; }
    h3 { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 66ch; }
    a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    a:hover { text-decoration-color: var(--ink); }
    a:focus-visible { outline: none; border-radius: 3px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--desk), 0 0 0 4px var(--pistachio-ink); }
    ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
    li { margin: 2px 0; }
    li::marker { color: var(--ink-2); }
    h2 + ul { columns: 2 260px; column-gap: 32px; }
    section {
      background: var(--sheet); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px 20px; margin: 12px 0;
    }
    section ul { columns: 2 240px; column-gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    section p { font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    pre {
      margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      background: var(--sheet-2); color: var(--ink-2); padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 7px;
      font: 12px/1.55 "DM Mono", ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
  <p>Clipiccolo is built with the following Rust crates. Each license text below is followed by the crates it covers.
     ffmpeg, Lucide and WebView2 are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.</p>
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <ul>
    {{#each overview}}
    <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <h2>License texts</h2>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section>
    <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
    <p>Used by:</p>
    <ul>
      {{#each used_by}}
      <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
